My funniest message occured when I was messing around in Wizard mode
once. I had magic protection off the scale and decided to jack around
with the gods a bit. I prayed on every turn and refused to make them
happy. They sent down plagues of Bone Devils and such which I rapidly
dispatched. Finally my god zapped me with a black bolt of lightning. The
message said I stood and basked in the rays of this bolt and seemed
totally unharmed. My god looked down on me still standing there and
said: "I believe it not!".

And then there was the time that the game informed me that I should quit
since I had entered a parallel universe, the laws of physics and nature
no longer applied and the game was irreversably screwed up...

